#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "That GPU node or GPU does not exist, or is on a device you do not have access to."
msgstr "Taj GPU čvor ili GPU ne postoji ili se nalazi na uređaju kojem nemate pristup."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU data query could not be added to the device. Check that the plugin's templates are installed."
msgstr "Upit podataka za GPU nije moguće dodati na uređaj. Provjerite jesu li predlošci dodatka instalirani."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "Uređaj: uređaj čvora je obrisan, stoga se čvor može samo onemogućiti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "Uređaj: izaberite postojeći Cacti uređaj."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "Uređaj: ovaj uređaj već jest GPU čvor."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "GPU čvor je spremljen."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "GPU čvor nije bilo moguće spremiti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "GPU čvor je uklonjen. Njegov Cacti uređaj ostao je netaknut."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "GPU čvor nije uklonjen jer mu pripadaju zapisi GPU-a. Umjesto toga onemogućite čvor; zapisi GPU-a nikada se ne brišu."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "GPU sada pripada čvoru na kojem je opažen, zajedno sa svojom poviješću."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "GPU ostaje pridružen svom evidentiranom čvoru."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "GPU će biti izostavljen iz upita podataka pri sljedećem ponovnom indeksiranju. Njegovi grafovi i RRD datoteke ostaju pohranjeni."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "Iz upita podataka može se ukloniti samo odsutan GPU."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "Izrada uređaja zahtijeva dopuštenje za upravljanje Cacti uređajima."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "Opis: unesite do 150 ispisivih znakova."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "Naziv poslužitelja: unesite naziv poslužitelja ili IP adresu."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "Predložak uređaja GPU Node nije instaliran."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "Uređaj nije zadržan: vaš račun nema ovlasti vidjeti uređaje koje izradi. Zatražite od administratora da ga izradi."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "Uređaj se nije mogao ukloniti nakon odbijanja pristupa. Zatražite od administratora da ga ukloni."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "Uređaj i njegov GPU čvor su izrađeni. Postavite SNMP postavke uređaja na stranici tog uređaja."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be created; see the Cacti log."
msgstr "Uređaj nije bilo moguće izraditi; provjerite Cacti dnevnik."

#: gpu_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Nadzorni prikaz"

#: gpu_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Opažanja nije bilo moguće pročitati. Zatražite od administratora da provjeri dnevnik dodatka."

